            "t3": "Live & upcoming · open to everyone · for the Commons",
            "t4": "Ways",
            "t5": "to get involved.",
            "t6": "Living pathways into bioregional participation — Commons Sense Teach-Ins, Solidarity Suppers, Neighborhood Resiliency, Allocation Rounds.",
            "t7": "All to provide a practical backbone for the establishment of the Front Range Bioregional Commons, SPIRIT offers care-based programs to foster solidarity within our neighborhoods and communities, and to bridge with the displaced original ancestors of these lands to find a good way forward together.",
